Z||000000||gtsonly||07-14-2001||08:24 PM||||An hour and a half drive to Kitty Hawk, a month of preparation, a joining of two states and there Fiero's and what happens when we all are to meet at 1 o'clock? Nothing cause noboby showed up, accept for collen ( I believe) in her 87 silver GT. What happened? North Carolina and Virgina clubs are not doing to good in my eyes. Post after post about this impromtu show with something like 20 cars coming and no one shows. Was it changed? If so why was it not told to anyone. Collen (I believe) had a flyer put out from the VA. club showing the event!!!!!!  The drive was nice, by myself!!!!<P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||13
