Z||000003||Formula88||07-14-2001||08:46 PM||||Aw, MAN that sucks!  For me it was attack of Friday the 13th.  Me, Pat, Bob and Terry were going to get together and convoy down.  Bob emails me Friday night to tell me his exhaust manifold just took a holiday, and now he can't drive it.  Crap...  So I go out to pack my Formula, and what do I find?  A big screw stuck in my left front tire.  I can't get it fixed till payday, and it's too big to plug, so I'm out.  Pat decided not to go, since we were going to be splitting the hotel room (it's a 4 hour drive for us - so we were going to stay overnight).  I emailed Terry to let him know.  I never heard back, but I guess he decided not to go it alone.<P>That's a crying shame, cuz we were all looking forward to it.  Maybe we can try to reschedule it agian?  Is anyone interested?||||reg||9
